\newlabel{fig:roman_pca}{{4}{9}{Pythia-6.9B on Roman numerals. 2D PCA at the helix-peak layer reveals discrete clusters by Roman-numeral prefix (I/V, X, L, XC), with the trajectory line zigzagging at threshold integers. The representation is a partition, not a continuous manifold}{figure.caption.16}{}}
